// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`US-LOOP-129 managed-runtime help > freezes single-locale EN/ZH delta, worktree, and Supervisor help 1`] = `
{
  "en": {
    "audit": "Usage: roll worktree audit [--json] [--repo <path>]
  Read-only audit of all git worktrees registered for this repo.
  Classifies ownership, dirt, merge evidence, and disposition.
  --json    print schema-1 JSON output
  --repo    override the project root (default: current directory)
",
    "cleanup": "Usage: roll worktree cleanup [--dry-run | --apply] [--json] [--repo <path>]
  Safely release a managed WorkspaceSet; the worktree audit is the SOLE authority.
  A release requires confirmed merge, accepted attest, and a fresh
  \`safe_to_release\` result for EVERY registered member. \`handoff_ready\` is not
  delivery: any handoff, unknown, stale, dirty, active, external, or unregistered
  member means the entire Story reservation is preserved. Nothing is selected merely because
  it is old, and recovery is non-destructive until the owner resolves the blocker.

  Always dry-run first. Default (no flag) is --dry-run.
  --dry-run  print the audit-derived release/refusal plan. Never mutates Git
             state or clears a reservation.
  --apply    re-run the audit before release; any changed head, new dirt, missing
             path, or concurrent activation fails closed without substitution.
             Resolve the blocker, then resume explicitly: roll loop resume
  --json     emit the same schema-1 plan (dry-run) or result (apply) as JSON
  --repo     override the project root (default: current directory)
  --reclaim-orphan <path>  (FIX-1460) bounded-rm ONE named orphan loop dir
             (deregistered from git; delivery not auto-provable) after you
             review it. Fails closed unless it is an inactive loop orphan
             inside .roll/loop/worktrees. Orphans never enter --apply.
",
    "delta": "Usage: roll delta <prepare|validate|conclude|status|help>

  Delta Team (host-guided) = the current host main session (implicit Supervisor)
  plus host-native Designer/Builder/Evaluator sub-agent sessions, driven through
  roll delta. Roll never spawns, resumes, or configures any session, including
  yours.

  Managed-runtime boundary:
    - prepare for solo or delta-team atomically holds the Story delivery reservation,
      creates one managed WorkspaceSet beneath .roll/loop/worktrees, and returns its
      detached checkout and publish-ref identity. Start the Builder only there.
    - host-guided full-delta-team is refused before side effects; Full Delta attaches
      to an existing Cycle WorkspaceSet and never creates a nested Delta workspace.
    - handoff_ready preserves the reservation and workspace. It is NOT Done, a merge,
      an attest verdict, or a DeliveryRecord. Cleanup needs confirmed merge plus
      accepted attest and a fresh all-member inspection.
    - Legacy/external paths remain visible as unknown or unmanaged; Roll never adopts
      or deletes them automatically.

  Honest protocol boundary:
    - Host attestation is structural validation only (non-empty/unique tokens that
      correspond across resolution/event/manifest); never proof of a fresh session
      or that a model executed.
    - Presets live in ~/.roll/delta-team/presets.yaml (host-local config only).
    - Host-guided cost renders ? (host_unobservable) — never estimated or zeroed.

  Host-guided delegation lifecycle commands (protocol-only; no agent spawning).

  roll delta prepare <story-id> --trigger host-guided --topology solo|delta-team|full-delta-team --profile standard|verified|designed --preset <id> --resolution <path> [--continuation-run <name>] [--json]
    Atomically reserve delivery, allocate the managed workspace, and create the immutable frame.
    --continuation-run only takes over a task that was explicitly redelegated to <name>
    (owner_redelegate --continuation-run <name>): it verifies the recorded redelegation,
    creates a fresh standard delta run, and swaps the occupancy atomically — it never
    touches any other task.

  roll delta validate --delegation <id> --stage designer|builder|evaluator|peer [--json]
    Validate a role-stage submission through the protocol-validator boundary.

  roll delta preflight --delegation <id> --stage builder [--json]
    Read-only Builder self-check: the same structural checks as formal
    validation, with no events and no lease/frame/workspace/checkpoint writes.
    Formal roll delta validate remains the only lifecycle gate.


  roll delta metrics [--from <epoch-ms|ISO>] [--to <epoch-ms|ISO>] [--json]
    Read immutable event and delivery truth. It never selects a rig, changes priority, or merges.

  roll delta conclude --delegation <id> --delivery-disposition owner_continue|owner_hold|owner_redelegate [--continuation-run <name>] [--json]
    Record owner-approved terminal binding (Option C: handoff_ready/handoff_only).
    owner_redelegate transfers the reservation to the named successor; the successor
    takes over with roll delta prepare --continuation-run <name>.

  roll delta status [--story <id>|--delegation <id>] [--json]
    Read-only delegation status projection from event truth.

  roll delta help
    Print this help.

  Managed Builder handoff:
    Save \`roll delta preflight --delegation <id> --stage builder --json\` stdout outside the managed frame.
    Then run validate with \`--preflight-receipt <path>\`; a missing, stale, or malformed receipt writes no lifecycle event.
",
    "dispatch": "Usage: roll worktree dispatch allocate <story-id> <dispatch-run-id> --actions <json>
       roll worktree dispatch integrate <story-id> <dispatch-run-id> <action-id> <commit>
       roll worktree dispatch release <story-id> <dispatch-run-id>
       roll worktree dispatch confirm <story-id> <dispatch-run-id> [--json]
       roll worktree dispatch stop <story-id> <dispatch-run-id> --reason <text> --confirm <story-id> [--json]
  Allocate one parent Skill DeliveryRun and detached child workspaces below .roll/loop/worktrees.
  <json> is an array of { actionId, declaredFileScope }. Only the parent run may publish, attest, close, release, or stop.
  confirm only finalizes a run after independent merge, accepted-attest, and clean-workspace checks.
  stop only abandons a clean, unmerged, unpublished run; its branches and retained commits stay available for audit.
",
    "supervisor": "Usage: roll supervisor [status|observe|advise|next|why|live|metrics|journal|health|route|repair-evidence] [--json]
  status           observe + advise summary (alias for no subcommand)
  observe          structured project facts (backlog, truth coverage, PRs, release readiness)
  advise           Supervisor decisions (advisory; persistent changes need owner confirmation)
  next             what should Roll do next?
  why              why is the project stuck?
  live             read-only Supervisor live board with Designer/Builder/Evaluator panes and shared DeliveryRun truth
  live --watch     redraw the role board in-place until Ctrl-C; use --interval <sec>
  live --collab    follow the multi-cycle collaboration stream; add --once for a snapshot
  metrics          read-only queue, dependency, delivery, and reconciliation lag projection; never routes work, changes priority, or merges
  journal          structured supervisor narrative stream: list/record decisions, verifications, rescues
  health           agent toolchain health: auth/network/setup/worktree classification and routing
  route            Role route trace: --role builder|designer|evaluator|peer_reviewer [--story <id>]
  repair-evidence  repair missing acceptance evidence for a green PR and restore merge-ready status",
    "worktree": "Usage: roll worktree <audit|cleanup|dispatch> [options]
  audit    Read-only audit of registered Git worktrees: ownership, dirt, merge evidence, and disposition.
  cleanup  Audit-derived managed WorkspaceSet release or non-destructive refusal: release only after confirmed merge, accepted attest, and every member is safe_to_release (--dry-run first, then --apply).
  dispatch Allocate a parent-owned managed WorkspaceSet; only the parent run may publish, attest, close, or release.
",
  },
  "zh": {
    "audit": "用法：roll worktree audit [--json] [--repo <path>]
  只读审计本仓库已注册的 Git 工作树。
  输出归属、脏改动、合并证据和处置；外部或旧记录只呈现，不自动认领。
  --json    输出 schema-1 JSON
  --repo    覆盖项目根目录（默认：当前目录）
",
    "cleanup": "用法：roll worktree cleanup [--dry-run | --apply] [--json] [--repo <path>]
  只以工作树审计为唯一权威安全释放受管 WorkspaceSet。释放必须同时满足已确认合并、已接受
  attest，以及每个已注册成员重新审计为 \`safe_to_release\`。handoff_ready 不等于已交付；任一
  成员处于交接、未知、过期、脏、活动、外部或未注册状态，整个 Story 预留都会保留。不会只因
  路径陈旧而选择它；在所有者解决阻塞前，恢复始终非破坏性。

  默认（无标志）为 --dry-run，绝不修改 Git 状态或清除预留。
  --dry-run  输出由审计导出的释放/拒绝计划。
  --apply    释放前重新审计；HEAD、脏改动、路径或并发活动变化即失败关闭，绝不替换对象。
             解决阻塞后手动恢复：roll loop resume
  --json     输出同一 schema-1 计划（演练）或结果（执行）JSON
  --repo     覆盖项目根目录（默认：当前目录）
  --reclaim-orphan <path>  审查后回收一个点名的、已解除 Git 注册的受管孤儿目录；绝不自动回收。
",
    "delta": "用法：roll delta <prepare|validate|conclude|status|help>

  Delta Team（host-guided）= 当前宿主主会话（隐式 Supervisor）加上由宿主 native
  能力创建的 Designer/Builder/Evaluator 子会话，通过 roll delta 驱动。Roll 从不
  spawn、resume 或配置任何会话（包括你自己的）。

  受管运行时边界：
    - solo 或 delta-team 的 prepare 会原子持有 Story 交付预留，在
      .roll/loop/worktrees 下创建一个受管 WorkspaceSet，并返回 detached checkout
      和 publish-ref 身份。Builder 只能在该工作区开始。
    - host-guided full-delta-team 会在副作用前被拒绝；Full Delta 只附着到既有 Cycle
      WorkspaceSet，绝不创建嵌套 Delta 工作区。
    - handoff_ready 会保留预留和工作区；它不是 Done、merge、attest 裁定或
      DeliveryRecord。清理必须有已确认合并、已接受 attest 和新鲜的全成员检查。
    - 旧路径/外部路径只会作为 unknown 或 unmanaged 可见；Roll 从不自动认领或删除。

  如实的协议边界：
    - 宿主 attestation 仅结构校验（token 非空/唯一且在 resolution/事件/manifest 间
      对应）；绝不证明会话新起或模型执行过。
    - preset 放在 ~/.roll/delta-team/presets.yaml（仅宿主本地配置）。
    - host-guided 成本渲染 ? (host_unobservable)——绝不估算或写零。

  宿主导引的委派生命周期命令（仅协议层；不启任何 agent）。

  roll delta prepare <story-id> --trigger host-guided --topology solo|delta-team|full-delta-team --profile standard|verified|designed --preset <id> --resolution <path> [--continuation-run <name>] [--json]
    原子预留交付、分配受管工作区，并创建不可变帧。
    --continuation-run 只接手明确转交给 <name> 的任务（owner_redelegate --continuation-run
    <name>）：它会核对已落盘的转交记录，创建全新的标准 delta 运行，并原子替换占用——
    绝不触碰其他任务。

  roll delta validate --delegation <id> --stage designer|builder|evaluator|peer [--json]
    经过协议校验边界验证角色阶段提交。

  roll delta preflight --delegation <id> --stage builder [--json]
    只读建造者自检：与正式校验相同的结构检查，不写任何事件，也不改动
    lease/帧/工作区/检查点。正式 roll delta validate 仍是唯一生命周期门。


  roll delta metrics [--from <epoch-ms|ISO>] [--to <epoch-ms|ISO>] [--json]
    只读不可变事件和交付真相；绝不选择模型组合、改变优先级或合并。

  roll delta conclude --delegation <id> --delivery-disposition owner_continue|owner_hold|owner_redelegate [--continuation-run <name>] [--json]
    记录 owner 批准的终止绑定（Option C：handoff_ready/handoff_only）。
    owner_redelegate 会把占用转交给指定继任名字；继任者用 roll delta prepare
    --continuation-run <name> 接手。

  roll delta status [--story <id>|--delegation <id>] [--json]
    从事件真相只读投影委派状态。

  roll delta help
    打印此帮助。

  受管 Builder 交接：
    把 \`roll delta preflight --delegation <id> --stage builder --json\` 的 stdout 保存在受管帧外。
    随后用 \`--preflight-receipt <path>\` 运行 validate；收据缺失、过期或格式损坏时不写生命周期事件。
",
    "dispatch": "用法：roll worktree dispatch allocate <story-id> <dispatch-run-id> --actions <json>
       roll worktree dispatch integrate <story-id> <dispatch-run-id> <action-id> <commit>
       roll worktree dispatch release <story-id> <dispatch-run-id>
       roll worktree dispatch confirm <story-id> <dispatch-run-id> [--json]
       roll worktree dispatch stop <story-id> <dispatch-run-id> --reason <原因> --confirm <story-id> [--json]
  分配一个由父 Skill DeliveryRun 持有、位于 .roll/loop/worktrees 下的受管 WorkspaceSet。
  <json> 为 { actionId, declaredFileScope } 数组；只有父运行可发布、验收、关闭、释放或停止。
  confirm 只会收尾已合入、已验收且所有目录干净的运行。
  stop 只会停止干净、未合入、未发布的运行；分支和保留提交会留下供核对。
",
    "supervisor": "用法：roll supervisor [status|observe|advise|next|why|live|metrics|journal|health|route|repair-evidence] [--json]
  status           observe + advise 摘要（无子命令的别名）
  observe          项目结构化事实（backlog、真相覆盖、PR、发布就绪度）
  advise           Supervisor 建议（持久化更改需 owner 确认）
  next / why       下一步与阻塞原因
  live             只读实时面板：Designer/Builder/Evaluator 和共同 DeliveryRun 真相
  live --watch     原地重绘面板，Ctrl-C 退出；可用 --interval <sec>
  live --collab    跟随多周期协作流；加 --once 读取快照
  metrics          只读投影：排队、依赖、交付与对账耗时；绝不路由工作、改变优先级或合并
  journal          Supervisor 叙事流：列出/记录决策、验证、救援
  health           agent 工具链健康：auth/network/setup/worktree 分类与路由
  route            角色路由追踪：--role builder|designer|evaluator|peer_reviewer [--story <id>]
  repair-evidence  修复绿色 PR 缺失的验收证据并恢复 merge-ready 状态",
    "worktree": "用法：roll worktree <audit|cleanup|dispatch> [options]
  audit    只读审计所有已注册 Git 工作树：归属、脏改动、合并证据与处置。
  cleanup  按审计结果释放受管 WorkspaceSet，或以非破坏性方式拒绝：仅在已确认合并、已接受 attest 且所有成员均为 safe_to_release 后释放（先 --dry-run，再 --apply）。
  dispatch 分配由父 DeliveryRun 持有的受管 WorkspaceSet；只有父运行可发布、验收、关闭或释放。
",
  },
}
`;
